OL,3,GNEWSAPolice in victim appeal after
OL,4,Achild rapist jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man jailed for raping a
OL,7,Fseven-year-old girl more than 40 years
OL,8,Fago may have abused others, police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FAlan Pearce, 70, was sentenced at Leeds
OL,12,FCrown Court to 14 years in prison after
OL,13,Fbeing found guilty of raping and
OL,14,Findecently assaulting the child between
OL,15,F1983 and 1985.
OL,17,FThe woman reported the offences in
OL,18,F2021, prompting an investigation by
OL,19,FKirklees child safeguarding detectives,
OL,20,Fwho brought charges against Pearce in
OL,21,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
