OL,3,GNEWSAPolice in victim appeal after
OL,4,Achild rapist jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Sgt Paul Campbell, from West
OL,7,FYorkshire Police, said investigations
OL,8,Fsuggested there could be other victims
OL,9,Fand appealed for them to come forward.
